# Project Structure

## Tech Stack

- **Framework**: Next.js 15.5 (App Router, standalone output)
- **UI**: React 19, Tailwind CSS v4, shadcn/ui (new-york style)
- **State**: TanStack Query (server), Zustand (client), nuqs (URL)
- **Forms**: react-hook-form + Zod
- **Database**: PostgreSQL + Drizzle ORM
- **Auth**: Supabase
- **i18n**: next-international (en, pl)
- **Testing**: Storybook + Vitest

## Root Directory Structure

```
/
├── src/                 # All source code
├── middlewares/         # Custom middleware chain utilities
├── public/              # Static assets (images, SVGs)
├── .storybook/          # Storybook configuration
├── types/               # Global TypeScript declarations (axios.d.ts)
└── drizzle.config.ts    # Drizzle ORM configuration
```

## src/ Organization

```
src/
├── api/                 # API client (axios) and interceptors
│   ├── clients/         # Axios instance configuration
│   └── interceptors/    # Request/response interceptors
├── app/                 # Next.js App Router pages
│   ├── [locale]/        # Internationalized routes
│   │   ├── (auth)/      # Auth pages group (login, sign-up, etc.)
│   │   └── (dashboard)/ # Dashboard pages group (inventory, sales, etc.)
│   └── api/             # API routes (REST endpoints)
├── components/          # Shared components (Atomic Design)
│   ├── atoms/           # Smallest components (buttons, inputs)
│   ├── molecules/       # Composed components (search bar, date picker)
│   ├── organisms/       # Complex components (data tables, sidebars)
│   ├── templates/       # Page-level layouts
│   └── ui/              # shadcn/ui components (DO NOT EDIT DIRECTLY)
├── constants/           # App constants
│   ├── routes.ts        # Navigation routes
│   ├── public-routes.ts # Unauthenticated routes
│   ├── languages.ts     # Supported languages
│   └── date-formats.ts  # Date format constants
├── features/            # Feature modules (see feature-module.mdc)
├── hooks/               # Shared React hooks
├── lib/                 # Utility libraries
│   └── utils.ts         # cn() helper for class merging
├── locales/             # i18n translations
│   ├── client.ts        # Client-side i18n setup
│   ├── server.ts        # Server-side i18n setup
│   ├── en/              # English translations
│   └── pl/              # Polish translations
├── providers/           # React context providers
├── server/              # Server-only code
│   ├── db/              # Database (Drizzle schema, migrations)
│   └── utils/           # Server utilities
├── shared/              # Cross-feature shared code
│   ├── api/             # Shared API functions
│   ├── hooks/           # Shared query hooks
│   └── server/          # Shared server code
├── store/               # Zustand stores
├── types/               # TypeScript types and interfaces
│   ├── enum/            # Type enums
│   └── interfaces/      # Type interfaces
└── utils/               # Utility functions
```

## Path Aliases

Use these aliases for imports (configured in tsconfig.json):

| Alias | Path | Usage |
|-------|------|-------|
| `@/*` | `./src/*` | General src imports |
| `@components/*` | `./src/components/*` | Shared components |
| `@features/*` | `./src/features/*` | Feature modules |
| `@hooks/*` | `./src/hooks/*` | Shared hooks |
| `@lib/*` | `./src/lib/*` | Library utilities |
| `@server/*` | `./src/server/*` | Server-only code |
| `@types/*` | `./src/types/*` | TypeScript types |
| `@constants/*` | `./src/constants/*` | App constants |
| `@utils/*` | `./src/utils/*` | Utility functions |
| `@assets/*` | `./public/assets/*` | Static assets |

## Import Order

Imports are automatically sorted by ESLint:

1. Built-in/External packages (react, next, etc.)
2. Internal modules (@/*, @components/*, etc.)
3. Parent imports (../)
4. Sibling/index imports (./)
5. Object imports

Always use path aliases instead of relative paths when crossing directory boundaries.

## Key Files Reference

| Purpose | Location |
|---------|----------|
| API client | `src/api/clients/api.ts` |
| Auth provider | `src/features/auth/providers/auth-providers.tsx` |
| Query provider | `src/providers/providers.tsx` |
| Hydration boundary | `src/providers/hydration-boundary-provider.tsx` |
| Middleware entry | `src/middleware.ts` |
| Public routes | `src/constants/public-routes.ts` |
| DB connection | `src/server/db/index.ts` |
| DB schema | `src/server/db/schema/` |
| User utility | `src/server/utils/get-logged-in-user.ts` |
